# E2E

1. Before writing or changing E2E, read `@.config/AGENTS/e2e-testing.md`.
2. Use `@grafana/plugin-e2e` fixtures/page models; prefer Grafana selectors and role/name.
3. Tests must be independent — no order dependence or leftover browser state from prior cases.
4. Provision stub providers only; never call real OpenAI/DeepSeek or commit real credentials.
5. Do not hardcode datasource UIDs, dashboard UIDs, or panel IDs to force a pass.
6. Provider configuration/model discovery scenarios live in plan T4: `@docs/provider-model-selection-execution-plan.md`.
